+     <para>
+      Fix incremental JSON parser's handling of numeric tokens that cross
+      input buffer boundaries (Andrew Dunstan)
+      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;2e373785e">&sect;</ulink>
+     </para>
+
+     <para>
+      It was possible to accept an incorrectly-formatted number, leading
+      to failures later.
+     </para>
+    </listitem>
+
+    <listitem>
+<!--
+Author: Robert Haas <rhaas@postgresql.org>
+Branch: master [ffc226ab6] 2026-03-09 06:45:32 -0400
+Branch: REL_18_STABLE [9540c0e5d] 2026-03-09 06:46:20 -0400
