+     <para>
+      Prevent stuck slotsync worker processes from blocking promotion of a
+      standby server (Nisha Moond, Ajin Cherian)
+      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;15910b1c3">&sect;</ulink>
+      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;586f4266f">&sect;</ulink>
+      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;4bed04d39">&sect;</ulink>
+     </para>
+
+     <para>
+      A worker process that was vainly waiting for a response from the
+      primary would delay promotion for an unreasonable amount of time.
+     </para>
+    </listitem>
+
+    <listitem>
+<!--
+Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
+Branch: master [85c17f612] 2026-04-13 10:06:50 +0530
+Branch: REL_18_STABLE [540fe8fb5] 2026-04-13 09:42:51 +0530
