+-->
+     <para>
+      Fix excessive log output from idle slotsync worker processes
+      (Zhijie Hou)
+      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;91741b7cb">&sect;</ulink>
+     </para>
+    </listitem>
+
+    <listitem>
+<!--
+Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
+Branch: master [739477345] 2026-03-30 13:59:58 -0400
+Branch: REL_18_STABLE [adb7873bb] 2026-03-30 13:59:54 -0400
