+     </para>
+
+     <para>
+      This miscalculation led to out-of-bounds accesses and hence server
+      crashes.
+     </para>
+    </listitem>
+
+    <listitem>
+<!--
+Author: Heikki Linnakangas <heikki.linnakangas@iki.fi>
+Branch: master [ccae90abd] 2026-03-02 19:19:22 +0200
+Branch: REL_18_STABLE [0a50ef094] 2026-03-02 19:19:26 +0200
