+     <para>
+      Fix assorted minor errors in error messages (Man Zeng, Tianchen Zhang)
+      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;67ad4387b">&sect;</ulink>
+      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;263af458e">&sect;</ulink>
+      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;5995135f1">&sect;</ulink>
